flowchart LR
    Console[Owner console<br/>ordinary authority-compiled runtime]
    Browser[Browser<br/>fragment-only bearer]
    GET[Inert enrollment GET<br/>no-store, no-referrer, bundled JS]
    Form[CSRF form<br/>history scrub before token fill]
    POST[Enrollment POST<br/>one-use exchange and session renewal]
    Operations[Operations.HostedOwners<br/>current activation rechecked under locks]
    Scope[Private exact write scope<br/>registered process + transaction + action + row]
    Owner[(Operations.HostedOwner<br/>one active per binding)]
    Accounts[Accounts.User narrow scoped actions<br/>reviewer only, terminal disable]
    Tokens[Existing JWT and Token actions<br/>15-minute enrollment purpose, one-use revoke]
    Session[Normal stored user-purpose session]
    Authority[Live owner resolver<br/>fresh user + owner + binding + activation]
    Boot[Boot exact user set<br/>disabled history has zero unexpired unrevoked tokens]
    Audit[(Audit ledger<br/>same transaction, no password/token bytes)]
    HumanAuthority[Audit.HumanAuthority<br/>lower-owned role, metadata, owner and write-scope behaviour]
    AuditMetadata[Audit.Tenant and ProvenanceSnapshot<br/>lower-owned human read checks]
    Ordinary[Ordinary constant provider<br/>roles unchanged, no scoped User writes]
    WorkerControl[Operations MacWorker controls<br/>fresh owner; worker then head lock; fresh recheck]
    Worker[(MacWorker<br/>one active per binding; terminal disable)]
    TranscriptReader[Agents.RemoteTranscripts<br/>head lock then fresh owner recheck]
    TranscriptScope[Private named-action read scope<br/>process + transaction + actor + call]
    Transcript[(RemoteCallResult<br/>immutable sensitive bytes)]
    Diagnostic[Explicit diagnostic result after commit<br/>not released business output]

    Console -- marked enrollment / disable --> Operations
    Operations --> Scope
    Scope --> Owner
    Scope --> Accounts
    Operations --> Tokens
    Tokens -- enrollment token returned to console only --> Console
    Console -- URL presenter adds secret in fragment only --> Browser
    Browser -- HTTP receives no fragment --> GET
    GET -- bundled handoff, no automatic submit --> Form
    Form -- explicit POST --> POST
    POST -- same transaction: consume link then mint session --> Operations
    Tokens -- exchange on current active owner only --> Session
    Owner --> Authority
    Accounts --> Authority
    Authority -- review_read / assign only --> Review[Prototype review and assignment policies]
    Authority -- exact live self disable --> Operations
    Authority -- owner-only mac_worker_control, never delegated --> WorkerControl
    WorkerControl -- current tenant and binding only --> Worker
    Worker -- same-transaction redacted event --> Audit
    Authority -- owner-only transcript_read, never delegated --> TranscriptReader
    TranscriptReader --> TranscriptScope
    TranscriptScope -- exact named action and field check --> Transcript
    TranscriptReader -- AuditAccess in same transaction, no bytes in event --> Audit
    TranscriptReader -- only after successful access commit --> Diagnostic
    WebPrincipal[Hosted website admission<br/>live owner or exact persisted bound auditor]
    Authority --> WebPrincipal
    WebPrincipal -- login / mount / connected revalidation --> Session
    Boot --> Owner
    Boot --> Accounts
    Boot --> Tokens
    Owner --> Audit
    Accounts --> Audit
    Accounts -- lower policy checks --> HumanAuthority
    AuditMetadata -- lower human freshness / hosted identity checks --> HumanAuthority
    HumanAuthority -. explicit prototype compile-time provider .-> Operations
    HumanAuthority -. ordinary build .-> Ordinary
    Operations -- fresh legacy eligibility / exact private write scope --> HumanAuthority

    %% Source-only implementation, not a deployment or real-data approval.
    %% Owner schema and POST verified on synthetic disposable databases.
    %% Worker controls and transcript reader are source implemented; claim revocation and owner UI remain pending.
    %% Ordinary production builds without prototype authority cannot enroll or exchange.
